<Base
  title="48 Hours in Santa Barbara | 48 Hours in California"
  description="A relaxed 48-hour Santa Barbara itinerary with Spanish Colonial history, Pacific views, the Funk Zone, Santa Barbara wine, and time to enjoy the city without turning the weekend into a checklist."
